# With completed tasks hidden, Enter at the end of a task whose only child is done makes the next sibling, since the task shows no children (editing.md §3: a new first child only for visible children).
file <<END
Trip:
	- Pack
		- Socks @done
	- Leave
END
keys gc
hide Socks
keys j <Enter> <Enter>
type Shoes
keys <Esc>
see ▌   - Shoes
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	- Pack
		- Socks @done
	- Shoes
	- Leave
END
